  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is:</strong> A dual-ended brush for liquid and cream foundations, featuring a flat side for precise application and a dome side to buff and build coverage.</p><p><br><strong>Brush Formulation:</strong> All Formulas</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable</p><p><br><strong>Bristle Type:</strong> Synthetic</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> It is cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Patrick wanted to give you artistry precision and blend-ability in one skin-loving foundation brush. </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the flat side of the brush to lay down cr&#232;me or liquid foundation with precision, painting on product exactly where you need coverage.<br>-Use the domed side to diffuse, buff, and blend into skin, building up to your desired level of coverage.</div></details>",
